designer_notes = "PLACEHOLDER (PROGRESS 110, 2026-11-18, Luke: \"map everything to placeholder abilities and I'll try them in action\"): a motion lab move (game/regents/motion/) on a placeholder built from existing atoms, to try as a prototype. Its name, numbers and what it really does are Luke's. Sword, plain grip, an ult: a rising cut into a leap and a ground pound that throws what it lands on into the air (leap_slam.tres, knocked_up.tres); the lunge's dash is the leap's travel."
